{"candidateAnswer":"Tattoo of her four dogs","evidence":"[D3:26 | 4:19 pm on 16 April, 2023] Audrey: I know right? They mean the world to me. So much that I got tattoos of them on my arm.\n[D15:1 | 9:58 pm on 16 August, 2023] Audrey: Hey Andrew, since we last spoke I got another tattoo of my four dogs on my arm! They really mean a lot to me so I thought it'd be nice to have them with me wherever I go. What've you been up to?\n[D23:20 | 4:22 pm on 13 October, 2023] Audrey: Thanks! I think right now its enough. Unless someday I decide to get another dog. Maybe I'll get another tattoo when that happens.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7e59170c-8515-5110-84ee-11e82c2baf4c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6cf6d40e41d9bb7cddb493eee14fcc579acd816b2d947f096364c5c469c5ceaa","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of tattoo does Audrey have on her arm?","referenceAnswer":"Tattoos of her four dogs.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6cf6d40e41d9bb7cddb493eee14fcc579acd816b2d947f096364c5c469c5ceaa"}}]}